  "definition": "Application Process for Individuals Seeking Plumbing Licenses",
  "effectiveDate": "2007-09-20",
  "historyNote": "#5213, eff 8-28-91, EXPIRED: 8-28-97 New. #8542, eff 1-20-06; ss by #8981, eff 9-20-07",
